{"4764490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nock Nock Loose", "steam_appid": 4764490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short incremental tower defense game where you defend your city from enemy armies. Sharpen your archers' aim, unlock powerful abilities in a massive skill tree, and crush every warlord who dares besiege your walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically select your targets and maximize the accuracy of your archers to defend against incoming waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764490/extras/5ea52d414e65c4b59b1f774c61c79253.poster.avif?t=1785836277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764490/extras/5ea52d414e65c4b59b1f774c61c79253.webm?t=1785836277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764490/extras/5ea52d414e65c4b59b1f774c61c79253.mp4?t=1785836277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your defenses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn gold to upgrade and strengthen your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764490/extras/8dd2859e610e7b4de2906e2d1de1d7e4.poster.avif?t=1785836277\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764490/extras/8dd2859e610e7b4de2906e2d1de1d7e4.webm?t=1785836277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4764490/extras/8dd2859e610e7b4de2906e2d1de1d7e4.mp4?t=1785836277\" type=\"vide